  select c.id, 'grammar', 24, $q$KG24$q$, $q$24. If Conditionals: zero and first$q$, $q$Shart gaplar (0 va 1-tur) · 200 ta test$q$, 24, $q${"intro":{"what":"Shart gaplar: “agar …, …”. Zero — doim to‘g‘ri bo‘ladigan fakt; First — kelajakda bo‘lishi mumkin bo‘lgan real holat.","when":[],"structures":[],"rules":[],"signal_words":[],"topics":[{"name":"Zero conditional","name_uz":"0-tur: fakt","summary":"If + Present Simple, Present Simple. Ilmiy faktlar, doim shunday bo‘ladigan narsalar.","usage":[{"text":"Fakt.","example":{"en":"If you heat ice, it melts.","uz":"Muzni isitsang, u eriydi."}},{"text":"Odat natijasi.","example":{"en":"If I am tired, I go to bed early.","uz":"Charchasam, erta yotaman."}}],"structure":[{"type":"+","formula":"If + Present Simple, Present Simple","example":{"en":"If it rains, the grass gets wet.","uz":"Yomg‘ir yog‘sa, maysa ho‘l bo‘ladi."}}],"signals":[],"tip":"if o‘rniga when qo‘ysa ham ma’no o‘zgarmaydi: When you heat ice, it melts."},{"name":"First conditional","name_uz":"1-tur: real kelajak","summary":"If + Present Simple, will + asl fe’l. if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi!","usage":[{"text":"Bo‘lishi mumkin bo‘lgan kelajak.","example":{"en":"If it rains tomorrow, we will stay at home.","uz":"Ertaga yomg‘ir yog‘sa, uyda qolamiz."}},{"text":"Ogohlantirish va va’da.","example":{"en":"If you touch the dog, it will bite you.","uz":"Itga tegsang, seni tishlaydi."}}],"structure":[{"type":"+","formula":"If + Present Simple, will + verb","example":{"en":"If you study, you will pass.","uz":"O‘qisang, o‘tasan."}},{"type":"+","formula":"will + verb + if + Present Simple","example":{"en":"We’ll be late if we don’t hurry.","uz":"Shoshilmasak, kechikamiz."}}],"signals":[],"tip":"“If it will rain” — XATO. If it rains …"},{"name":"unless, when","name_uz":"unless va when","summary":"unless = if … not (agar … masa). when — aniq bo‘ladigan ish uchun.","usage":[{"text":"unless","example":{"en":"Unless you hurry, you’ll miss the bus.","uz":"Shoshilmasang, avtobusga ulgurmaysan."}},{"text":"when","example":{"en":"I’ll call you when I get home.","uz":"Uyga yetganimda qo‘ng‘iroq qilaman."}}],"structure":[],"signals":[],"tip":"unless bilan yana not qo‘yilmaydi: Unless you hurry (Unless you don’t hurry — XATO)."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"If it will rain, we will stay home.","right":"If it rains, we will stay home.","why":"if-qismda will yo‘q."},{"wrong":"If you heat ice, it melt.","right":"If you heat ice, it melts.","why":"it → -s."},{"wrong":"If you study, you pass the exam tomorrow.","right":"If you study, you will pass the exam tomorrow.","why":"Kelajak natija → will."},{"wrong":"Unless you don’t hurry, …","right":"Unless you hurry, …","why":"unless = if not."}]},"parts":[],"translations":[],"test":[{"type":"mc","q":"If you exercise every day, you ___ healthy. (har kuni mashq qilsang, sog‘lom bo‘lasan)","options":["stay","would stay","stays","staying"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If plants don’t get water, they ___. (o‘simlik suvsiz qurib qoladi)","options":["die","would die","diing","dies"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you mix red and yellow, you ___ orange. (qizil + sariq = to‘q sariq)","options":["gets","would get","geting","get"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you leave milk in the sun, it ___ bad. (sutni quyoshda qoldirsang, ayniydi)","options":["going","goes","would go","go"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you don’t water flowers, they ___. (gullarga suv quymasang, quriydi)","options":["would die","die","diing","dies"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you don’t eat, you ___ hungry. (ovqat yemasang, och qolasan)","options":["would feel","feels","feeling","feel"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If the sun goes down, it ___ dark. (quyosh botsa, qorong‘i tushadi)","options":["would get","get","geting","gets"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you heat ice, it ___. (muzni isitsang, eriydi)","options":["would melt","melting","melt","melts"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you put sugar in tea, it ___ sweet. (choyga shakar solsang, shirin bo‘ladi)","options":["taste","tasting","would taste","tastes"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If I drink coffee at night, I ___ awake. (kechasi qahva ichsam, uyg‘oq qolaman)","options":["would stay","stay","staying","stays"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you drop a glass, it ___. (stakan tushsa, sinadi)","options":["would break","breaks","break","breaking"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you freeze water, it ___ ice. (suv muzlasa, muzga aylanadi)","options":["becomes","becoming","become","would become"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you put oil in water, it ___. (moy suvda qalqib turadi)","options":["floating","floats","would float","float"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you heat water to 100°C, it ___. (suv 100°C da qaynaydi)","options":["boil","boiling","boils","would boil"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If it snows, the roads ___ slippery. (qor yog‘sa, yo‘llar sirpanchiq bo‘ladi)","options":["geting","would get","get","gets"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you mix blue and yellow, you ___ green. (ko‘k + sariq = yashil)","options":["geting","gets","would get","get"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you boil an egg, it ___ hard. (tuxumni qaynatsang, qattiq bo‘ladi)","options":["get","geting","would get","gets"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you touch fire, it ___. (olovga tegsang, kuydiradi)","options":["hurt","hurts","hurting","would hurt"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If my mum is angry, she ___. (onam jahli chiqsa, baqiradi)","options":["shouts","would shout","shout","shouting"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If babies are hungry, they ___. (chaqaloqlar och qolsa, yig‘laydi)","options":["would cry","cries","crying","cry"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If people don’t sleep, they ___ tired. (odam uxlamasa, charchaydi)","options":["gets","get","would get","geting"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If it rains, the grass ___ wet. (yomg‘ir yog‘sa, maysa ho‘l bo‘ladi)","options":["geting","would get","gets","get"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If you press this button, the door ___. (tugmani bossang, eshik ochiladi)","options":["opening","would open","opens","open"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If my cat is happy, it ___. (mushugim xursand bo‘lsa, xurillaydi)","options":["purr","purring","purrs","would purr"],"part":0},{"type":"mc","q":"If Mum cooks plov, we ___ together. (onam palov pishirsa, birga yeymiz)","options":["would eat","will eat","will eats","will to eat"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ miss the film if we don’t leave now.","options":["would","will","do","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If she misses the bus, she ___ late. (avtobusga ulgurmasa, kechikadi)","options":["would be","will is","will be","will to be"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"She ___ be late if she misses the bus.","options":["would","will","does","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If Ali comes to the party, we ___ happy. (Ali bazmga kelsa, xursand bo‘lamiz)","options":["will is","will to be","will be","would be"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If Ali calls me, I ___ him everything. (Ali qo‘ng‘iroq qilsa, hammasini aytaman)","options":["will tells","would tell","will tell","will to tell"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If we hurry, we ___ the train. (shoshilsak, poyezdga ulguramiz)","options":["will to catch","will catches","would catch","will catch"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If you read this book, you ___ it. (bu kitobni o‘qisang, yaxshi ko‘rib qolasan)","options":["will loves","will to love","will love","would love"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If the weather is nice, we ___ a picnic. (havo yaxshi bo‘lsa, piknik qilamiz)","options":["would have","will have","will to have","will haves"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"You ___ get a bad mark if you don’t listen in class.","options":["will","do","would","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If my dad haves time, he ___ us to the zoo. (dadamning vaqti bo‘lsa, bizni hayvonot bog‘iga olib boradi)","options":["will take","will takes","will to take","would take"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"He ___ buy a new bike if he saves money.","options":["would","does","will","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If I get a good mark, my parents ___ proud. (yaxshi baho olsam, ota-onam faxrlanadi)","options":["will be","will is","would be","will to be"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"You ___ love it if you read this book.","options":["would","do","will","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"You ___ pass the exam if you study hard.","options":["wills","do","will","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ make a snowman if it snows tonight.","options":["do","will","would","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"You ___ feel ill if you eat too much.","options":["will","do","wills","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ go to the beach if it is sunny.","options":["do","will","would","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If you don’t listen in class, you ___ a bad mark. (darsda tinglamasang, yomon baho olasan)","options":["will to get","would get","will gets","will get"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"She ___ come to school if she feels better.","options":["would","does","will","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"He ___ get a medal if my brother wins the race.","options":["will","does","wills","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"I ___ tell him everything if Ali calls me.","options":["will","would","wills","do"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"He ___ take us to the zoo if my dad haves time.","options":["will","does","wills","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ eat together if Mum cooks plov.","options":["will","wills","do","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If they invite us, we ___ to the wedding. (taklif qilishsa, to‘yga boramiz)","options":["will go","would go","will to go","will goes"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If you help me, I ___ you an ice cream. (yordam bersang, muzqaymoq olib beraman)","options":["would buy","will buy","will to buy","will buys"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If you eat too much, you ___ ill. (ko‘p yesang, kasal bo‘lasan)","options":["will feel","would feel","will feels","will to feel"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ stay at home if it rains tomorrow.","options":["wills","do","will","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"I ___ buy you an ice cream if you help me.","options":["will","wills","do","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If it rains tomorrow, we ___ at home. (ertaga yomg‘ir yog‘sa, uyda qolamiz)","options":["will stay","would stay","will stays","will to stay"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If I find your book, I ___ it to you. (kitobingni topsam, senga beraman)","options":["will gives","would give","will to give","will give"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"The air ___ be cleaner if we plant trees.","options":["wills","does","will","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If they win the match, they ___ a prize. (o‘yinda yutishsa, sovrin olishadi)","options":["will get","will gets","would get","will to get"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"You ___ miss the bus if you don’t hurry.","options":["will","would","wills","do"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"She ___ speak English well if Malika practises every day.","options":["does","would","will","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"My parents ___ be proud if I get a good mark.","options":["does","would","will","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"I ___ buy some bread if the shop is open.","options":["will","wills","would","do"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ have a picnic if the weather is nice.","options":["do","will","would","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If it is cold, I ___ my hat. (sovuq bo‘lsa, shapkamni kiyaman)","options":["will to wear","will wear","would wear","will wears"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If it snows tonight, we ___ a snowman. (bugun kechasi qor yog‘sa, qorbobo yasaymiz)","options":["would make","will makes","will make","will to make"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ask the teacher, she ___ the rule again. (o‘qituvchidan so‘rasang, qoidani qayta tushuntiradi)","options":["will explain","would explain","will to explain","will explains"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"It ___ grow fast if you water the plant.","options":["would","does","wills","will"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If we leave now, we ___ on time. (hozir chiqsak, vaqtida yetib boramiz)","options":["would arrive","will to arrive","will arrive","will arrives"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ go to the wedding if they invite us.","options":["wills","will","do","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"You ___ be tired if you go to bed late.","options":["do","wills","would","will"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ be happy if Ali comes to the party.","options":["wills","do","will","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"We ___ catch the train if we hurry.","options":["will","do","would","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"It ___ break if you drop the phone.","options":["does","wills","will","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If you go to bed late, you ___ tired. (kech yotsang, charchaysan)","options":["will be","would be","will to be","will is"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"She ___ explain the rule again if you ask the teacher.","options":["will","would","does","wills"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If she feels better, she ___ to school. (o‘zini yaxshi his qilsa, maktabga keladi)","options":["will come","will to come","would come","will comes"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If you don’t wear a coat, you ___ a cold. (palto kiymasang, shamollaysan)","options":["will catch","would catch","will to catch","will catches"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If you study hard, you ___ the exam. (yaxshi o‘qisang, imtihondan o‘tasan)","options":["would pass","will pass","will passes","will to pass"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If the shop is open, I ___ some bread. (do‘kon ochiq bo‘lsa, non olaman)","options":["will buy","will buys","would buy","will to buy"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If we plant trees, the air ___ cleaner. (daraxt eksak, havo tozaroq bo‘ladi)","options":["will be","would be","will to be","will is"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"It ___ bite you if you touch the dog.","options":["wills","would","will","does"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If my brother wins the race, he ___ a medal. (akam poygada yutsa, medal oladi)","options":["would get","will gets","will get","will to get"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If I see Vali, I ___ him the news. (Valini ko‘rsam, unga yangilikni aytaman)","options":["will tells","will tell","would tell","will to tell"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"I ___ tell him the news if I see Vali.","options":["wills","do","will","would"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If he saves money, he ___ a new bike. (pul yig‘sa, yangi velosiped oladi)","options":["would buy","will buys","will buy","will to buy"],"part":1},{"type":"mc","q":"If my brother ___ the race, he will get a medal. (win)","options":["wining","wins","win","will win"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If she ___ the bus, she will be late. (miss)","options":["miss","will miss","misses","missing"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If Ali ___ to the party, we will be happy. (come)","options":["comes","coming","come","will come"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ this book, you will love it. (read)","options":["read","reading","will read","reads"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If Malika ___ every day, she will speak English well. (practise)","options":["practises","practising","practise","will practise"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If I ___ Vali, I will tell him the news. (see)","options":["will see","sees","see","seing"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___, you will miss the bus. (hurry — inkor)","options":["don’t hurry","won’t hurry","doesn’t hurry","not hurry"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If it ___ tomorrow, we will stay at home. (rain)","options":["raining","will rain","rain","rains"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ a coat, you will catch a cold. (wear — inkor)","options":["won’t wear","don’t wear","doesn’t wear","not wear"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If Ali ___ me, I will tell him everything. (call)","options":["calls","call","will call","calling"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If we ___ now, we will miss the film. (leave — inkor)","options":["won’t leave","not leave","doesn’t leave","don’t leave"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If it ___ sunny, we will go to the beach. (be)","options":["being","will be","are","is"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If it ___ cold, I will wear my hat. (be)","options":["will be","are","being","is"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If I ___ a good mark, my parents will be proud. (get)","options":["will get","geting","get","gets"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ too much, you will feel ill. (eat)","options":["eats","eating","will eat","eat"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If they ___ the match, they will get a prize. (win)","options":["wins","will win","wining","win"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ in class, you will get a bad mark. (listen — inkor)","options":["won’t listen","doesn’t listen","don’t listen","not listen"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ the teacher, she will explain the rule again. (ask)","options":["asks","asking","ask","will ask"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If the weather ___ nice, we will have a picnic. (be)","options":["are","will be","is","being"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If we ___ now, we will arrive on time. (leave)","options":["leaving","leave","leaves","will leave"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If I ___ your book, I will give it to you. (find)","options":["will find","finding","finds","find"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If it ___ tonight, we will make a snowman. (snow)","options":["will snow","snowing","snows","snow"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ me, I will buy you an ice cream. (help)","options":["helping","will help","help","helps"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If we ___, we will catch the train. (hurry)","options":["will hurry","hurry","hurries","hurrying"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If the shop ___ open, I will buy some bread. (be)","options":["will be","being","are","is"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ the dog, it will bite you. (touch)","options":["touch","touching","touches","will touch"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ the phone, it will break . (drop)","options":["droping","drop","will drop","drops"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If Mum ___ plov, we will eat together. (cook)","options":["cooking","will cook","cook","cooks"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If my dad ___ time, he will take us to the zoo. (have)","options":["will have","haves","have","having"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ hard, you will pass the exam. (study)","options":["study","will study","studying","studies"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ to bed late, you will be tired. (go)","options":["will go","go","going","goes"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If she ___ better, she will come to school. (feel)","options":["will feel","feeling","feel","feels"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If we ___ trees, the air will be cleaner. (plant)","options":["plant","planting","will plant","plants"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If he ___ money, he will buy a new bike. (save)","options":["saves","saving","save","will save"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If they ___ us, we will go to the wedding. (invite)","options":["will invite","invite","invites","inviting"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"If you ___ the plant, it will grow fast. (water)","options":["will water","watering","waters","water"],"part":2},{"type":"mc","q":"___ the weather is nice, we won’t have a picnic. (= If the weather isn’t …)","options":["So","Unless","When","If"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ it snows tonight, we won’t make a snowman. (= If it doesn’t snow …)","options":["If","Unless","So","When"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ she misses the bus, she won’t be late. (= If she doesn’t miss …)","options":["So","If","Unless","When"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ he saves money, he won’t buy a new bike. (= If he doesn’t save …)","options":["When","If","So","Unless"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ you touch the dog, it won’t bite you. (= If you don’t touch …)","options":["So","If","When","Unless"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"We’ll go out ___ the rain stops. (yomg‘ir albatta to‘xtaydi)","options":["when","unless","so","if"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ Ali comes to the party, we won’t be happy. (= If Ali doesn’t come …)","options":["So","When","Unless","If"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ I find your book, I won’t give it to you. (= If I don’t find …)","options":["If","So","Unless","When"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ you go to bed late, you won’t be tired. (= If you don’t go …)","options":["When","So","Unless","If"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ you read this book, you won’t love it. (= If you don’t read …)","options":["So","When","If","Unless"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ you drop the phone, it won’t break . (= If you don’t drop …)","options":["When","If","So","Unless"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"I’ll call you ___ I get home. (uyga albatta boraman)","options":["so","when","unless","if"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ my dad haves time, he won’t take us to the zoo. (= If my dad doesn’t have …)","options":["Unless","When","So","If"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ you study hard, you won’t pass the exam. (= If you don’t study …)","options":["If","When","So","Unless"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ we hurry, we won’t catch the train. (= If we don’t hurry …)","options":["If","Unless","When","So"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ they invite us, we won’t go to the wedding. (= If they don’t invite …)","options":["Unless","So","If","When"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ you eat too much, you won’t feel ill. (= If you don’t eat …)","options":["Unless","If","When","So"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ you water the plant, it won’t grow fast. (= If you don’t water …)","options":["So","When","Unless","If"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ Malika practises every day, she won’t speak English well. (= If Malika doesn’t practise …)","options":["When","If","Unless","So"],"part":3},{"type":"mc","q":"___ I see Vali, I won’t tell him