r":"Unless","explain":"unless = if not.","wrong":{"If":"Ma’no “agar … masa” → Unless (= If … not).","When":"when — “qachonki” (aniq bo‘ladi).","So":"so — shuning uchun."}},{"answer":"Unless","explain":"unless = if not.","wrong":{"If":"Ma’no “agar … masa” → Unless (= If … not).","When":"when — “qachonki” (aniq bo‘ladi).","So":"so — shuning uchun."}},{"answer":"Unless","explain":"unless = if not.","wrong":{"If":"Ma’no “agar … masa” → Unless (= If … not).","When":"when — “qachonki” (aniq bo‘ladi).","So":"so — shuning uchun."}},{"answer":"If my dad haves time, he will take us to the zoo.","explain":"First conditional: If my dad haves time, he will take us to the zoo.","wrong":{"If my dad will have time, he will take us to the zoo.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If my dad haves time, he will takes us to the zoo.":"will + asl fe’l.","If my dad haves time, he would take us to the zoo.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you don’t eat, you feel hungry.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you don’t eat, you feel hungry.","wrong":{"If you don’t eat, you feels hungry.":"you bilan -s yo‘q.","If you don’t eat, you would feel hungry.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you don’t eat, you feeling hungry.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If I drink coffee at night, I stay awake.","explain":"Zero conditional: If I drink coffee at night, I stay awake.","wrong":{"If I drink coffee at night, I stays awake.":"I bilan -s yo‘q.","If I drink coffee at night, I would stay awake.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If I drink coffee at night, I staying awake.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If Mum cooks plov, we will eat together.","explain":"First conditional: If Mum cooks plov, we will eat together.","wrong":{"If Mum will cook plov, we will eat together.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If Mum cooks plov, we will eats together.":"will + asl fe’l.","If Mum cooks plov, we would eat together.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If we don’t leave now, we will miss the film.","explain":"First conditional: If we don’t leave now, we will miss the film.","wrong":{"If we won’t leave now, we will miss the film.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If we don’t leave now, we will misses the film.":"will + asl fe’l.","If we don’t leave now, we would miss the film.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you don’t water flowers, they die.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you don’t water flowers, they die.","wrong":{"If you don’t water flowers, they dies.":"they bilan -s yo‘q.","If you don’t water flowers, they would die.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you don’t water flowers, they diing.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If my cat is happy, it purrs.","explain":"Zero conditional: If my cat is happy, it purrs.","wrong":{"If my cat is happy, it purr.":"it → -s.","If my cat is happy, it would purr.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If my cat is happy, it purring.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If plants don’t get water, they die.","explain":"Zero conditional: If plants don’t get water, they die.","wrong":{"If plants don’t get water, they dies.":"they bilan -s yo‘q.","If plants don’t get water, they would die.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If plants don’t get water, they diing.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If it snows tonight, we will make a snowman.","explain":"First conditional: If it snows tonight, we will make a snowman.","wrong":{"If it will snow tonight, we will make a snowman.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If it snows tonight, we will makes a snowman.":"will + asl fe’l.","If it snows tonight, we would make a snowman.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you mix blue and yellow, you get green.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you mix blue and yellow, you get green.","wrong":{"If you mix blue and yellow, you gets green.":"you bilan -s yo‘q.","If you mix blue and yellow, you would get green.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you mix blue and yellow, you geting green.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If I see Vali, I will tell him the news.","explain":"First conditional: If I see Vali, I will tell him the news.","wrong":{"If I will see Vali, I will tell him the news.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If I see Vali, I will tells him the news.":"will + asl fe’l.","If I see Vali, I would tell him the news.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If I find your book, I will give it to you.","explain":"First conditional: If I find your book, I will give it to you.","wrong":{"If I will find your book, I will give it to you.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If I find your book, I will gives it to you.":"will + asl fe’l.","If I find your book, I would give it to you.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If we leave now, we will arrive on time.","explain":"First conditional: If we leave now, we will arrive on time.","wrong":{"If we will leave now, we will arrive on time.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If we leave now, we will arrives on time.":"will + asl fe’l.","If we leave now, we would arrive on time.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If she feels better, she will come to school.","explain":"First conditional: If she feels better, she will come to school.","wrong":{"If she will feel better, she will come to school.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If she feels better, she will comes to school.":"will + asl fe’l.","If she feels better, she would come to school.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you don’t wear a coat, you will catch a cold.","explain":"First conditional: If you don’t wear a coat, you will catch a cold.","wrong":{"If you won’t wear a coat, you will catch a cold.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you don’t wear a coat, you will catches a cold.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you don’t wear a coat, you would catch a cold.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you drop a glass, it breaks.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you drop a glass, it breaks.","wrong":{"If you drop a glass, it break.":"it → -s.","If you drop a glass, it would break.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you drop a glass, it breaking.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If you heat ice, it melts.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you heat ice, it melts.","wrong":{"If you heat ice, it melt.":"it → -s.","If you heat ice, it would melt.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you heat ice, it melting.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If you touch the dog, it will bite you.","explain":"First conditional: If you touch the dog, it will bite you.","wrong":{"If you will touch the dog, it will bite you.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you touch the dog, it will bites you.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you touch the dog, it would bite you.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you eat too much, you will feel ill.","explain":"First conditional: If you eat too much, you will feel ill.","wrong":{"If you will eat too much, you will feel ill.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you eat too much, you will feels ill.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you eat too much, you would feel ill.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If they win the match, they will get a prize.","explain":"First conditional: If they win the match, they will get a prize.","wrong":{"If they will win the match, they will get a prize.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If they win the match, they will gets a prize.":"will + asl fe’l.","If they win the match, they would get a prize.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If my brother wins the race, he will get a medal.","explain":"First conditional: If my brother wins the race, he will get a medal.","wrong":{"If my brother will win the race, he will get a medal.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If my brother wins the race, he will gets a medal.":"will + asl fe’l.","If my brother wins the race, he would get a medal.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you press this button, the door opens.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you press this button, the door opens.","wrong":{"If you press this button, the door open.":"the door → -s.","If you press this button, the door would open.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you press this button, the door opening.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If you ask the teacher, she will explain the rule again.","explain":"First conditional: If you ask the teacher, she will explain the rule again.","wrong":{"If you will ask the teacher, she will explain the rule again.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you ask the teacher, she will explains the rule again.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you ask the teacher, she would explain the rule again.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you boil an egg, it gets hard.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you boil an egg, it gets hard.","wrong":{"If you boil an egg, it get hard.":"it → -s.","If you boil an egg, it would get hard.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you boil an egg, it geting hard.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If you put sugar in tea, it tastes sweet.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you put sugar in tea, it tastes sweet.","wrong":{"If you put sugar in tea, it taste sweet.":"it → -s.","If you put sugar in tea, it would taste sweet.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you put sugar in tea, it tasting sweet.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If you study hard, you will pass the exam.","explain":"First conditional: If you study hard, you will pass the exam.","wrong":{"If you will study hard, you will pass the exam.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you study hard, you will passes the exam.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you study hard, you would pass the exam.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If it snows, the roads get slippery.","explain":"Zero conditional: If it snows, the roads get slippery.","wrong":{"If it snows, the roads gets slippery.":"the roads bilan -s yo‘q.","If it snows, the roads would get slippery.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If it snows, the roads geting slippery.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If you touch fire, it hurts.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you touch fire, it hurts.","wrong":{"If you touch fire, it hurt.":"it → -s.","If you touch fire, it would hurt.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you touch fire, it hurting.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If people don’t sleep, they get tired.","explain":"Zero conditional: If people don’t sleep, they get tired.","wrong":{"If people don’t sleep, they gets tired.":"they bilan -s yo‘q.","If people don’t sleep, they would get tired.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If people don’t sleep, they geting tired.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If Ali calls me, I will tell him everything.","explain":"First conditional: If Ali calls me, I will tell him everything.","wrong":{"If Ali will call me, I will tell him everything.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If Ali calls me, I will tells him everything.":"will + asl fe’l.","If Ali calls me, I would tell him everything.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If they invite us, we will go to the wedding.","explain":"First conditional: If they invite us, we will go to the wedding.","wrong":{"If they will invite us, we will go to the wedding.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If they invite us, we will goes to the wedding.":"will + asl fe’l.","If they invite us, we would go to the wedding.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you read this book, you will love it.","explain":"First conditional: If you read this book, you will love it.","wrong":{"If you will read this book, you will love it.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you read this book, you will loves it.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you read this book, you would love it.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you freeze water, it becomes ice.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you freeze water, it becomes ice.","wrong":{"If you freeze water, it become ice.":"it → -s.","If you freeze water, it would become ice.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you freeze water, it becoming ice.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If she misses the bus, she will be late.","explain":"First conditional: If she misses the bus, she will be late.","wrong":{"If she will miss the bus, she will be late.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If she misses the bus, she will is late.":"will + asl fe’l.","If she misses the bus, she would be late.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If it is cold, I will wear my hat.","explain":"First conditional: If it is cold, I will wear my hat.","wrong":{"If it will be cold, I will wear my hat.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If it is cold, I will wears my hat.":"will + asl fe’l.","If it is cold, I would wear my hat.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you help me, I will buy you an ice cream.","explain":"First conditional: If you help me, I will buy you an ice cream.","wrong":{"If you will help me, I will buy you an ice cream.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you help me, I will buys you an ice cream.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you help me, I would buy you an ice cream.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you go to bed late, you will be tired.","explain":"First conditional: If you go to bed late, you will be tired.","wrong":{"If you will go to bed late, you will be tired.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you go to bed late, you will is tired.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you go to bed late, you would be tired.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you heat water to 100°C, it boils.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you heat water to 100°C, it boils.","wrong":{"If you heat water to 100°C, it boil.":"it → -s.","If you heat water to 100°C, it would boil.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you heat water to 100°C, it boiling.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If I get a good mark, my parents will be proud.","explain":"First conditional: If I get a good mark, my parents will be proud.","wrong":{"If I will get a good mark, my parents will be proud.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If I get a good mark, my parents will is proud.":"will + asl fe’l.","If I get a good mark, my parents would be proud.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you exercise every day, you stay healthy.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you exercise every day, you stay healthy.","wrong":{"If you exercise every day, you stays healthy.":"you bilan -s yo‘q.","If you exercise every day, you would stay healthy.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you exercise every day, you staying healthy.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If babies are hungry, they cry.","explain":"Zero conditional: If babies are hungry, they cry.","wrong":{"If babies are hungry, they cries.":"they bilan -s yo‘q.","If babies are hungry, they would cry.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If babies are hungry, they crying.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If you don’t listen in class, you will get a bad mark.","explain":"First conditional: If you don’t listen in class, you will get a bad mark.","wrong":{"If you won’t listen in class, you will get a bad mark.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you don’t listen in class, you will gets a bad mark.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you don’t listen in class, you would get a bad mark.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If it is sunny, we will go to the beach.","explain":"First conditional: If it is sunny, we will go to the beach.","wrong":{"If it will be sunny, we will go to the beach.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If it is sunny, we will goes to the beach.":"will + asl fe’l.","If it is sunny, we would go to the beach.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If my mum is angry, she shouts.","explain":"Zero conditional: If my mum is angry, she shouts.","wrong":{"If my mum is angry, she shout.":"she → -s.","If my mum is angry, she would shout.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If my mum is angry, she shouting.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If we hurry, we will catch the train.","explain":"First conditional: If we hurry, we will catch the train.","wrong":{"If we will hurry, we will catch the train.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If we hurry, we will catches the train.":"will + asl fe’l.","If we hurry, we would catch the train.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If we plant trees, the air will be cleaner.","explain":"First conditional: If we plant trees, the air will be cleaner.","wrong":{"If we will plant trees, the air will be cleaner.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If we plant trees, the air will is cleaner.":"will + asl fe’l.","If we plant trees, the air would be cleaner.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If Malika practises every day, she will speak English well.","explain":"First conditional: If Malika practises every day, she will speak English well.","wrong":{"If Malika will practise every day, she will speak English well.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If Malika practises every day, she will speaks English well.":"will + asl fe’l.","If Malika practises every day, she would speak English well.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you mix red and yellow, you get orange.","explain":"Zero conditional: If you mix red and yellow, you get orange.","wrong":{"If you mix red and yellow, you gets orange.":"you bilan -s yo‘q.","If you mix red and yellow, you would get orange.":"Fakt → Present Simple.","If you mix red and yellow, you geting orange.":"Fakt → Present Simple."}},{"answer":"If it rains tomorrow, we will stay at home.","explain":"First conditional: If it rains tomorrow, we will stay at home.","wrong":{"If it will rain tomorrow, we will stay at home.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If it rains tomorrow, we will stays at home.":"will + asl fe’l.","If it rains tomorrow, we would stay at home.":"Real kelajak → will."}},{"answer":"If you water the plant, it will grow fast.","explain":"First conditional: If you water the plant, it will grow fast.","wrong":{"If you will water the plant, it will grow fast.":"if-qismda will ishlatilmaydi.","If you water the plant, it will grows fast.":"will + asl fe’l.","If you water the plant, it would grow fast.":"Real kelajak → will."}}]}$q$::jsonb from t
